===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|NL.|differentiātus}}, {{glossary|perfect}} {{glossary|passive}} {{glossary|participle}} of {{m|NL.|differentiō}} (see {{af|en|-ate|id1=verb|pos1=verb-forming suffix}} and {{af|en|-ate|id1=substantive|pos1=noun-forming suffix}}), from {{der|en|la|differentia||difference}}; see {{m|en|difference}}.

